    "evidence": [
      "CommandAllowMixing builds a full-line allow + optional underscore + mixing regex; Pattern2.compileInternal applies Pattern.CASE_INSENSITIVE.",
      "CommandPackage parses optional AS; executeArg passes AS to quarkInContext as the group identity and keeps NAME as display.",
      "CommandLinkClass resolves endpoints with CucaDiagram.quarkInContextSafe(true, endpoint) and creates missing leaves as LeafType.CLASS at the relationship location.",
      "CommandCreateElementFull2 resolves mixed declaration codes with quarkInContext(true, idShort) and updates display on an existing entity without recreating it.",
      "Ordinary class declarations are different: CommandCreateClass and CommandCreateClassMultilines call quarkInContextSafe(false, idShort), so they do not unique-reuse a same-short-name leaf from a different package."
    ]
  },
